d on real user needs</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Avoid over-engineering early it=
erations</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Prioritize User Experie=
nce Over Technical Elegance</strong>
