ot implementation details</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Clear error messages &gt; perfe=
ct error handling</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Perceived performance often &gt=
; actual performance</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Build for Failure, Not =
Just Success</strong>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
