sers will crash, servers will be overloaded</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Design recovery mechanisms from=
 day one</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Test failure scenarios as rigor=
ously as happy paths</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Monitor Everything, Opt=
imize Based on Data</strong>
