b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Collect metrics from real users=
, not synthetic tests</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Performance varies dramatically=
 across different environments</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">User behavior patterns reveal o=
ptimization opportunities</li>
</ul>
</li>
