<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=93=9A <st=
rong>Recommended Learning Path</strong></h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>For Junior Developers:</=
strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Master File API v=C3=A0 Blob ma=
nipulation</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Understand HTTP chunked transfe=
r encoding</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Learn basic error handling patt=
erns</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Practice v=E1=BB=9Bi small file=
 uploads first</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>For Senior Developers:</=
strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Deep dive into network protocol=
s (HTTP/2, WebRTC)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Study distributed systems conce=
pts</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Learn performance profiling tec=
hniques</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Understand browser engine diffe=
rences</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>For Principal Engineers:=
</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
